{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/927298-dance-and-music-based-solar","id":927298,"title":"Dance and Music based Solar","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-06T15:15:40-07:00","id":927298,"title":"Dance and Music based Solar","content":"There is a part of the game that i still haven been able to use, and that is music and dancing performance rolls.<br /> Just what is it that you can do with that kind of instill actions?<br /> Has someone made a dance and/or music based Solar? What do you think of those charms?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","name":"Sakii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-06T17:11:21-07:00","id":927361,"title":"","content":"One of my players made a party bard using Battle Anthem (of the Solar Exalted) and spends all of combat singing a song. It's a little boring, but combined with Soul Voice, they provide a drip of 2 Initiative <b>every round</b> <b>to the entire party</b> as well as granting (Essence) Automatic Successes to <b>all the attacks</b> <b>of an allied Battlegroup </b>and successful Withering attacks generate an <b>additional point of Initiative</b> also. Every round. It's very useful, though not overly exciting for the player of the song. They are restricted to Reflexive actions only. But when my player stunts it by actually singing a song every round, damn right I'm giving them 2 point stunts each time. They earned that Willpower.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":368,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","user":"The Unsung Hero","date":".  Corrected where the Auto Successes go to 07-07-2016, 10:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-06T17:16:11-07:00","id":927364,"title":"","content":"Also, the ability to make a person or people feel an emotion - <i>really feel</i> an emotion - that's invaluable. There's a reason that entertainers, orators, con artists, et cetera., <i>can</i> be as successful as they are, and no small part of that is that people's emotions are a powerful - albeit not-always-predictable - force.<br /> <br /> There's a reason David played the lyre for Saul.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 07-06-2016, 08:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-06T18:36:10-07:00","id":927387,"title":"","content":"Instill actions can create Emotions which can give bonuses to other social actions. They can also serve as a shortcut around certain types of persuade actions. If you make the target horny with your display of sexy dancing, they might try to seduce you, instead of you having to seduce them. Or what have you.<br /> <br /> If you want to turn your Performance towards combat, Dreaming Pearl Courtesan, Black Claw, and Silver Voiced Nightingale Styles are all centered around social effects and synergize well with Solar charms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-06T18:38:21-07:00","id":927388,"title":"","content":"I have made a Zenith who's concept is Rockstar. Haven't had a chance to play him yet, but I like the idea so far at least.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-06T21:13:46-07:00","id":927438,"title":"","content":"Essentially have a yozi cultist Eclipse performance user concept in mind, mostly inspired by this, basically persuading parties to sign oath with a magic performance:<br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/OY1TlxJORik\" data-code=\"OY1TlxJORik\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/OY1TlxJORik/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2127-eltacolibre","name":"Eltacolibre","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2127_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-07T05:13:29-07:00","id":927561,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/927298-dance-and-music-based-solar?p=927361#post927361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One of my players made a party bard using Battle Anthem (of the Solar Exalted) and spends all of combat singing a song. It's a little boring, but combined with Soul Voice, they provide a drip of 2 Initiative <b>every round</b> <b>to the entire party</b> as well as granting (Essence) Automatic Successes to <b>all the party's attacks</b> and successful Withering attacks generate an <b>additional point of Initiative</b> also. Every round. It's very useful, though not overly exciting for the player of the song. They are restricted to Reflexive actions only. But when my player stunts it by actually singing a song every round, damn right I'm giving them 2 point stunts each time. They earned that Willpower.</div> </div> </div> </div>Battle Anthem only adds dice/successes to the attacks of allied battle groups, so not all of the party's attacks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-07T06:54:10-07:00","id":927594,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crumplepunch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/927298-dance-and-music-based-solar?p=927561#post927561\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Battle Anthem only adds dice/successes to the attacks of allied battle groups, so not all of the party's attacks.</div> </div> </div> </div>You are correct. We didn't actually get that particular benefit in the last fight we did it, I just assumed the player forgot it, but it simply didn't apply. I misread it, my player did it right. Still, the mote drip alone is amazeballs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-07T07:48:05-07:00","id":927613,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/927298-dance-and-music-based-solar?p=927594#post927594\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You are correct. We didn't actually get that particular benefit in the last fight we did it, I just assumed the player forgot it, but it simply didn't apply. I misread it, my player did it right. Still, the mote drip alone is amazeballs.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, it's definitely still worth it, particularly since it only costs 1m, so you can inspire the circle with a short song whenever you have an action to spare.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-07T07:55:40-07:00","id":927619,"title":"","content":"You might want to suggest your singer character look into counterattack charms. If you are limited to reflexive actions those still give you an option to kind of participate in combat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/746-kunoichi","name":"Kunoichi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar746_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-07T10:02:15-07:00","id":927660,"title":"","content":"I have a harpist who is a Nightingale as well. A zenith who sees it as her job to help people, create a government that serves people, and to ensure Solars hold themselves to a high standard. She generally avoids combat entirely if possible, but her ability to inspire and lead people with a song is pretty fun to play. She also uses music to act as a priestess of the Unconquered Sun, using it to tell stories and inspire devotion.<br /> <br /> All in all I really enjoy playing her, and supernal performance has not let me down.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/944864-abyssals-in-death-s-dream-kingdom-homebrew-wip-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Abyssals</a><br /> <br /> My attempt at a homebrew for Abyssals, focusing on unique charms.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11602-five_gee","name":"Five_Gee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11602_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}